  click T_CV_TASK href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L98" "Runs at launch and whenever the token changes: bedtime, wake, notificationsEnabled, the nine per-kind toggles except goalLapse, quietHoursFollowSleepSchedule, quietHoursStartTime, quietHoursEndTime. Trailing-edge 500 ms debounce. Then purgePastEvents, PlacementRollover, ExamPrepSweep, PlanProposalSweep, cancelRetiredDailyNotifications, SessionCoordinator.syncIfActivityDismissed, reevaluate(.appLaunch), DistractionMonitor.apply." _blank
  click T_CV_SCENE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L169" "On scene-active: purgePastEvents, PlacementRollover, ExamPrepSweep, PlanProposalSweep, recordForegroundAndClassifyOutcomes, then reevaluate with .taskCompleted when nudge.arb.widgetMutated was set (and cleared), else .sceneActive. Then a Task: calendar refresh, autoPlanIfNewDay, NudgeCopyGenerator.generateIfNeeded." _blank
  click T_CV_DAY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/ContentView.swift#L255" "Inside the scene-active Task: a reevaluate after DayPlanEngine.autoPlanIfNewDay placed tasks, and another after NudgeCopyGenerator.generateIfNeeded returned true." _blank
  click T_SESS href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L71" "startSession writes nudge.lastFocusSessionStartedAt and sessionEnd before reevaluate(.sessionStarted); completing the session's task runs reevaluate(.taskCompleted); reevaluateAfterSessionEnd runs reevaluate(.sessionEnded)." _blank
  click T_UI href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L2347" "TasksTabView.refreshNotifications from about 17 edit sites. Also with .taskCreatedOrEdited: HomeTabView after brain-dump capture and after plan proposals are written; CalendarTabView after edits, deletes, planning a day and screenshot import; DayPlanRefiner after applying placements; NudgeCopyGenerator.noteShift after new copy. DEBUG launch arguments (EvalHarness, CaptureHistoryExporter, -nudge-import-ical) also call it." _blank
  click T_BG href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/NudgeApp.swift#L162" "The 6 AM background task; see the launch wiring picture." _blank
  click R_REEVAL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeArbiter.swift#L345" "appLaunch, sceneActive and backgroundTask are debounced for 60 s; the other reasons always run." _blank
